IgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork - USA\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-580x574.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x949.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-768x760.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10231\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,989\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork \u2013 USA\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x949.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk3IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5NyI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"197\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x197.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork - Netherlands\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x197.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-580x572.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x947.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-768x757.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9796\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,986\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork \u2013 Netherlands\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/netherlands_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x947.jpg\" /></a></div></figure><figure class='gallery-item'><div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n<a href='https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/portugal_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/'><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTk4IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE5OCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"198\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x198.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork - Portugal\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-200x198.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-580x574.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x949.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-768x760.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9974\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/portugal_ballad_of_john_and_yoko/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_ballad_of_john_and_yoko.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,989\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Ballad Of John And Yoko single artwork \u2013 Portugal\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/portugal_ballad_of_john_and_yoko-960x949.jpg\" /></a></div></figure></div><h2><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Chart_success\"></span>Chart success<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2><p>&#8216;The Ballad Of John And Yoko&#8217; was released in the UK on <a href=\"/1969/05/30/uk-single-the-ballad-of-john-and-yoko/\">30 May 1969</a>. It was rush-released just six weeks after it was recorded, while <a href=\"/songs/get-back/\">&#8216;Get Back&#8217;</a> was still at number one in the UK charts.</p><p>It topped the UK charts for three weeks, but only managed to reach number eight in America. The b-side in both countries was <a href=\"/people/george-harrison/\">George Harrison</a>\u2019s <a href=\"/songs/old-brown-shoe/\">&#8216;Old Brown Shoe&#8217;</a>.</p><div class=\"fab-forum-link\"><a href=\"/fab-forum/the-songs/the-ballad-of-john-and-yoko/\">Discuss &#8216;The Ballad Of John And Yoko&#8217; on the Fab Forum \u00bb</a></div><div class=\"page-links\">Pages: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/the-ballad-of-john-and-yoko/\" class=\"post-page-numbers\"><span class=\"page-link\">1</span></a> <span class=\"post-page-numbers current\" aria-current=\"page\"><span class=\"page-link\">2</span></span></div>",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-10-25"
}